      "name": "Spellstrike",
      "actions": 2,
      "category": "offensive",
      "text": "Frequency twice per day\n\n---\n\nEffect Onyiji casts a spell and couples it with a staff Strike. She casts Ignition, Ray of Frost, or Shocking Grasp, but the effects don't occur immediately. She makes a melee Strike with her staff and uses the attack roll result as the effect of both the Strike and the spell.\n\nThis counts as two attacks towards her multiple attack penalty, but the penalties don't apply until after the Spellstrike.",
